常委会 (2021). 个人信息保护法. 中国人大网. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://www.npc.gov.cn/npc/c2/c30834/202108/t20210820_313088.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://www.npc.gov.cn/npc/c2/c30834/202108/t20210820_313088.html"]},"：第四十五条「个人有权向个人信息处理者查阅、复制其个人信息……个人请求查阅、复制其个人信息的，个人信息处理者应当及时提供」；第四十六条更正、补充权；第四十七条列了五种应当主动删除的情形，含「（一）处理目的已实现、无法实现或者为实现处理目的不再必要」「（二）个人信息处理者停止提供产品或者服务，或者保存期限已届满」「（三）个人撤回同意」，「个人信息处理者未删除的，个人有权请求删除」；第五十条「个人信息处理者应当建立便捷的个人行使权利的申请受理和处理机制。拒绝个人行使权利的请求的，应当说明理由」「个人可以依法向人民法院提起诉讼」"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["注销账号和删除个人信息是两件事，注销之后还要单独提出删除。换手机或者卖旧手机之前，先在旧手机上把所有账号退出、解除绑定，再恢复出厂设置。法律给你的是事后的删除权，它不能替你把已经泄露出去的东西收回来。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/14-07"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"别为了用 App 点「全部同意」：不是必需的信息，你不同意也不能拒绝给你服务"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/14-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"刷脸不是必须答应的：有别的办法就不能只让你刷脸，你不同意得给你其他方式"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/14-02"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["邮箱密码单独一个，不和任何网站重复"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["别的网站被偷走的密码，会被人拿来直接登你的邮箱。邮箱一旦被人登进去，凡是能用邮箱找回密码的账号，都跟着一起丢。所以邮箱的密码要单独一个，别的地方一律不用。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/14-03"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["手机设锁屏密码，SIM 卡设 PIN 码"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["SIM 卡就是手机里那张小卡片，短信验证码靠它来收。手机丢了，捡到的人会把这张卡拔下来，插进别的手机收验证码，再挨个重置你的账号。给卡设一个 PIN 码，卡换到…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/14-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["手机丢了按这个顺序做：挂失 SIM 卡、远程锁定、改密码、报警、冻结银行卡"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["顺序比手快更重要。第一步挂失 SIM 卡，验证码这条命脉就断了。接着远程锁住手机，再用电脑改邮箱和支付密码，然后报警拿回执，最后看情况冻结银行卡。手机不在身上，…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/14-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["卡被盗刷先挂失冻结再报警，然后要求银行赔：证明「是你自己刷的」是银行的责任"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["卡被人盗刷，不用你去证明「这不是我刷的」。反过来，是银行要拿出证据证明这笔是你本人刷的，拿不出就得赔你。前提是你一发现就挂失冻结。拖着不挂失，后面多出来的损失要…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/14-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["每隔一段时间看一次账号的登录设备和已授权应用，不用的清掉"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["「登录设备」是指现在还能用你账号的那些手机和电脑。列表里冒出你不认识的设备，或者早就不用的软件还连着你的账号，就先改密码，再退出全部登录。邮箱还要看一眼，有没有…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/14-10"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["别把代码、密钥和隐私资料交给来路不明的「AI 中转站」，让 AI 自动执行命令时尤其如此"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["中转站夹在你和模型厂商中间，你发出去的内容和收回来的回答，它都看得见、改得了。有研究测了 400 多个中转站，9 个往回答里塞恶意代码，17 个动了研究者故意放…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/14"},"children":["阅读整个主题：账号与信息安全 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-star","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 